1
00:00:00,312 --> 00:00:01,692
- Why?
- Really, don't.

2
00:00:02,064 --> 00:00:06,444
Hot-air blowers are incubators
and spewers of bacteria and pestilence.

3
00:00:06,610 --> 00:00:09,400
It'd be more hygienic
if they had a plague-infested gibbon...

4
00:00:09,571 --> 00:00:11,821
(Sheldon:)...sneeze my hands dry.

5
00:00:11,990 --> 00:00:15,240
(Raj(entering excitedly):)Hey, guys.
I just got the most amazing new...

6
00:00:17,704 --> 00:00:21,374
(Penny:)Do you think you'll ever be able to talk
in front of me without being drunk?

7
00:00:24,211 --> 00:00:27,211
Okay, well, I'll just go eat by myself.

8
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:29,300
(Leonard:)- You don't have to do that.
- It's okay.

9
00:00:29,466 --> 00:00:32,676
Between him not talking,
him talking, and him...

10
00:00:34,888 --> 00:00:36,678
(Penny:)...I'm better off alone.

11
00:00:36,848 --> 00:00:39,268
So goodbye, you poor, strange little man.

12
00:00:44,022 --> 00:00:46,862
- She's so considerate.
- So, what's your news?

13
00:00:47,025 --> 00:00:49,865
Remember that little object
I spotted beyond the Kuiper belt?

14
00:00:50,028 --> 00:00:52,068
Oh, yeah, 2008-NQ sub-17.

15
00:00:52,239 --> 00:00:55,199
Or as I call it, Planet Bollywood.

16
00:00:55,617 --> 00:00:57,197
(Raj:)Anyway, because of my discovery...

17
00:00:57,369 --> 00:01:00,829
(Raj:)...People magazine is naming me
one of their 30 Under 30 to Watch.

